      "raw_time": false,
      "body": "Done. Cell `da90e284` now contains:\n\n```r\ngrid <- tibble(educ = 0:20)\n\npreds <- predict(fit_logit, new_data = grid, type = 'prob') |>\n    bind_cols(grid)\n\nggplot(grass_by_educ, aes(x = educ, y = grass)) +\n    geom_point() +\n    geom_line(data = preds, aes(y = .pred_yes))\n```\n\nRan successfully \u2014 the curve rises from ~0.09 at 0 years to ~0.54 at 20, matching the check. It's an S-shape, not a straight line (logistic).",
