              "output": "### Cell 14\n\n#### Metadata\n\n```yaml\nexecution:\n  iopub.execute_input: '2026-10-28T18:38:21.215727Z'\n  iopub.status.busy: '2026-10-28T18:38:21.215639Z'\n  iopub.status.idle: '2026-10-28T18:38:21.475517Z'\n  shell.execute_reply: '2026-10-28T18:38:21.475473Z'\n  shell.execute_reply.started: '2026-10-28T18:38:21.475455Z'\nexecution_count: 8\nid: da90e284\ntype: code\n```\n\n#### Source\n\n```python\ngrid <- tibble(educ = 0:20)\n\npreds <- predict(fit_logit, new_data = grid, type = 'prob') |>\n    bind_cols(grid)\n\nggplot(grass_by_educ, aes(x = educ, y = grass)) +\n    geom_point() +\n    geom_line(data = preds, aes(y = .pred_yes))\n```\n\n#### Output\n\n```\nplot without title```",
