      "body": "Sync complete. Pushed `de6a9ac..e5be37e` to origin.\n\n**Files that came in from the class repo (upstream/main):**\n- `exercises/13-spotify-exercise.ipynb`\n- `exercises/14-dengue-exercise.ipynb`\n- `notebooks/13-lecture-random-forest.ipynb`\n\n**\"-new\" files created:** none (no conflicts occurred).\n\nNotes: `gh` isn't installed, so I used the `git fetch upstream` + `git merge upstream/main` fallback instead of `gh repo sync`. The push was rejected once because origin had new work; I merged `origin/main` (no conflicts) and pushed normally. No force push, nothing deleted."
