    {
      "sender": "f251744eeda349039f0956b2692e9832",
      "body": "@OpenCode I am working in exercises/11-challenger-exercise.ipynb, with R and tidymodels.\nThe data frame challenger has a column temp (launch temperature, \u00b0F) and a\ncolumn damage_f (a factor with levels \"no\" and \"yes\").\n\nIn the empty code cell in step 2, fit a logistic regression of damage_f ~ temp\nwith logistic_reg(). Save it as fit_oring and show tidy(fit_oring). Run the cell.\nUse tidymodels only. Do not change any other cells.",
      "id": "920ec5b3-1429-4b4b-b64c-a90cadc8ca4d",
      "raw_time": false,
      "metadata": {
        "to_persona": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
        "web_client_id": "2e2510c1-e4dc-4906-aa5c-f99fcc3cd11a",
        "settings": {},
        "model": {
          "settings": {},
          "id": null
        }
      },
      "type": "msg",
