    {
      "body": "Done. Cell `55cf2be3`:\n\n```r\ngrid <- tibble(temp = 30:85)\n\npreds <- predict(fit_oring, new_data = grid, type = 'prob') |>\n    bind_cols(grid)\n\nggplot(challenger, aes(x = temp, y = damage)) +\n    geom_jitter(height = 0.05, width = 0) +\n    geom_line(data = preds, aes(y = .pred_yes)) +\n    geom_vline(xintercept = 31, linetype = 'dashed')\n```\n\nRan successfully \u2014 the curve is near 1 at 30\u00b0F and near 0 at 85\u00b0F, matching the check.",
